ight":62}]},{"type":"subquestion","id":"5b0c0763b","text":"Calcula els mols de totes les substancies que participen en la reacció\nDades: PM (C) = 12 u PM (O) = 16 u PM (H) = 1 u","points":"","numMode":"auto","customLabel":"","children":[]}]}],"origen":"material"}